# Secrets — this repo is public. Never commit an API key.
# The Coach tab reads the Claude key from the Keychain, the ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# environment variable, or an untracked LiftLog/Secrets.plist (see README ▸ Coach).
Secrets.plist
LiftLog/Secrets.plist
.env
*.local.xcconfig
